  "testimonials": [
    {
      "author": "Rick Sheider",
      "rating": 5,
      "body": "Arrived on time, told me what service was to be performed, and went straight to work. Answered my questions as he worked and kept me inform of how much longer until complete. Excellent experience."
    },
    {
      "author": "Robert Lcsd",
      "rating": 5,
      "body": "Been a customer for 20 plus years and have always had great service. Everyone I’ve dealt with either on the phone or in person has been very helpful and courteous. Keep up the great work."
    },
    {
      "author": "Outward Hounds",
      "rating": 5,
      "body": "When a tree limb fell on our HVAC unit, we called 2nd Wind and they were here within the hour. Unfortunately, the unit could not be fixed. Our technician got on the phone and found a replacement unit at the best possible price. He also asked if we needed a window unit to help since they wouldn’t be able to get the replacement done until Monday. He was very professional and very helpful."
    }
